\item \code{c2} (MSigDB Curated): selected gene sets from online pathway
databases and biomedical literature (KEGG and BioCarta removed for
licensing reasons)
\item \code{c3} (MSigDB Regulatory Target): potential targets of regulation
by transcription factors or miRNAs
\item \code{c4} (MSigDB Computational): defined by mining cancer-oriented
expression data (KEGG pathways removed for licensing reasons)
\item \code{c6} (MSigDB Oncogenic Signature): signatures of cellular pathways
often dysregulated in cancer
\item \code{c7} (MSigDB Immunologic Signature): gene sets associated with
immune disease
\item \code{c8} (MSigDB Cell Type Signature): curated markers for cell types
identified in single-cell sequencing studies of human tissue
